IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hpa-hirers`

-- Hire-Purchase Act 1969, ss 2, 5, 8, 11, 14-17, 21, 29, 32(5), 33, 35-37, 39, 48 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_hire-purchase-act-1969.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

